  "description": "The Twinify mapping engine. Turns profiles (and convention-compatible type pairs) into\n\t\texpression-compiled mapping delegates: auto-matching, flattening, nested objects and collections,\n\t\tconstructor mapping, and more - configure once, then execute a single cached delegate per Map call.\n\t\tIncludes a Roslyn source generator that emits static, reflection-free maps for Native AOT / trimming.",
